(13, 'Harbordale Elementary', '0491', 1, 'One of 27 BCPS Elementary Schools and 47 BCPS schools to earn the Florida Department of Education School of Excellence Award for the 2023-2024 School Year! We earned this prestigious award for scoring in the 80th percentile or higher in our grade calculation compared to schools in the same grade group for at least two of the past three school years.', '2025-02-07 14:46:00-04', null),
(13, 'Harbordale Elementary', '0491', 2, 'Recipient of the Golden School Award from the past 30+ years for excellence in parent and community member volunteerism on campus!', '2025-02-07 14:46:00-04', null),
(13, 'Harbordale Elementary', '0491', 3, 'All primary teachers are trained in research-based multisensory program UFLI Foundations from the University of Florida''s Literacy Institute!', '2025-02-07 14:46:00-04', null),
(13, 'Harbordale Elementary', '0491', 4, 'One of less than 15 BCPS schools that has a TEA (Technology Enabled Agriculture) Garden. Students engage in real-world, culturally relevant STEM project-based learning opportunities to create sustainable solutions to environmental challenges utilizing a range of technological innovations to monitor gardens, cultivation, and harvesting in their school and communities.', '2025-02-07 14:46:00-04', null),
(13, 'Harbordale Elementary', '0491', 5, 'We offer over 6 on-campus clubs in which students demonstrate our three core values: respect, kindness, and responsibility. Our student clubs sponsor annual food drives for the Harvest Drive, toys to donate to the Children’s Diagnostic and Treatment Center, and supplies for animals at the Broward County Humane Society.', '2025-02-07 14:46:00-04', null),
(14, 'Park Springs Elementary', '3171', 1, 'Park Springs offers an afterschool enrichment program, Extended Learning Opportunities Program (ELOP) to all students in K to 5 to include Yoga, Pickleball, Krafty Kids, Dancin Feet'' and more.', '2025-02-07 15:17:00-04', null),
(14, 'Park Springs Elementary', '3171', 2, 'Park Springs is continuously renovating the school with the help of the SMART Bond Referendum: the music room has a new floor, furniture, storage room for newly added instruments and ceiling, the art room has an updated ceiling, new storage shelving, a new art sink, and a fresh floor finish and the campus-wide renovations include re-roofing, a new fire alarm voice evacuation system, and fire sprinkler replacement.', '2025-02-07 15:17:00-04', null),
(14, 'Park Springs Elementary', '3171', 3, 'Park Springs offers extracurricular opportunities for students to get involved in the school and local community via clubs such as Student Council, Save Promise, Panther Bots, Panther Pals, Robotics Team, Debate, Environmental, Safety Patrol, Chorus and EWPSE.', '2025-02-07 15:17:00-04', null),
(14, 'Park Springs Elementary', '3171', 4, 'Park Springs has a very active parent volunteer base and supportive PTO who has partnered with the school to provide laptops making us a one to one school, promethean boards, school marquis and provide classroom grants for science enrichment to all classrooms.', '2025-02-07 15:17:00-04', null),
(14, 'Park Springs Elementary', '3171', 5, 'Park Springs has received awards and recognitions for: Being an iReady Super School, Winner of the P3 -Eco Challenge, Winning the Coral Springs MLK Art and Literacy Showcase for multiple years, Placing Top 3 schools for the Miami Heat Environmental Challenge and being a No Place for Hate school 3 years in row.', '2025-02-07 15:17:00-04', null),
(15, 'Annabel C. Perry PK - 8', '1631', 1, 'Annabel C. Perry PreK-8 has proudly moved from a “C” to a “B" school as rated by the Florida Department of Education last school year.', '2025-02-07 16:20:00-04', null),
(15, 'Annabel C. Perry PK - 8', '1631', 2, 'Annabel C. Perry Prek-8 is proud to have clubs such as Mentoring Tomorrow''s Leaders, 5000 Roles Models, National Junior Honors Society, Student Government Association, Student Council and Speech and Debate on our campus.', '2025-02-07 16:20:00-04', null),
(15, 'Annabel C. Perry PK - 8', '1631', 3, 'Annabel C. Perry PreK-8 is proud to provide each student with a world-class education within “A Culture of Caring”.', '2025-02-07 16:20:00-04', null),
(15, 'Annabel C. Perry PK - 8', '1631', 4, 'Annabel C. Perry PreK-8 received the Golden Library Award for having an outstanding library media program, thanks to our media specialist, Ms. Laura McCarthy.', '2025-02-07 16:20:00-04', null),
(15, 'Annabel C. Perry PK - 8', '1631', 5, 'Annabel C. Perry Prek-8 is an International Baccalaureate (IB) Primary Years Programme (PYP).  This distinction separates our students as learners by teaching them to inquire, question, explore, and learn more about the world around them.', '2025-02-07 16:20:00-04', null),
(16, 'Western High School', '2831', 1, 'Culinary Program- State of the Art Kitchen and Nationally Recognized Serv Safe Industry Certification', '2025-02-10 09:19:00-04', null),
(16, 'Western High School', '2831', 2, 'STEM Robotics, Rocketry and Solar Car Program- State and National qualifier every year!', '2025-02-10 09:19:00-04', null),
(16, 'Western High School', '2831', 3, 'JROTC- Western High School Wildcat Battalion 2025 State qualifiers', '2025-02-10 09:19:00-04', null),
(16, 'Western High School', '2831', 4, 'Western High Chorus- 2025 All State Finalist', '2025-02-10 09:19:00-04', null),
(16, 'Western High School', '2831', 5, 'Western High Cheerleading 2025 State, Regional and District Champions', '2025-02-10 09:19:00-04', null),
(17, 'Forest Glen Middle School', '3051', 1, 'Athletic Achievements: In addition to the eight sports governed by the Middle School Athletic Association (Soccer, Cross Country, Golf, Basketball, Track & Field Events, Flag Football, Volleyball, and Floorball), we also offer two unique opportunities – disc golf, and wrestling; our boys and girls wrestling teams won the 2023-2024 Broward Schools Middle School tournament.', '2025-02-10 15:43:00-04', null),
(17, 'Forest Glen Middle School', '3051', 2, 'Co-Curricular Advancement: We offer over 15 clubs, co-curricular activities, and mentoring programs, including pottery, gardening, robotics, Latinos in Action, and Divas of Today and Tomorrow, which foster creativity, leadership, and collaboration.', '2025-02-10 15:43:00-04', null),
(17, 'Forest Glen Middle School', '3051', 3, '21st Century Skills: As a Verizon Innovative Learning school (VILs), all students receive an iPad and our curriculum focuses on 21st century skills, including Digital Citizenship, Digital Tools, and Industry Certifications in Coding and Web Design.', '2025-02-10 15:43:00-04', null),
(17, 'Forest Glen Middle School', '3051', 4, 'Advanced Coursework and Innovative Programs: We offer 7 high school credit classes and various advanced courses, including Spanish 1 and 2, Debate, GEM Math, and Gears, within our Cambridge (Pre-AICE) program.', '2025-02-10 15:43:00-04', null),
(17, 'Forest Glen Middle School', '3051', 5, 'Inclusive Environment: We offer a 3-year VE program for Students with Disabilities primarily coming from cluster programs in elementary school (ASD, EBD, DHH), which ensures students’ needs are met in smaller classroom environments with a differentiated approach. (AND #6)- Award-Winning Diversified Arts Programs: Our award-winning Band and Chorus programs scored Superior at the 23-24 MPAs, and both programs have sent multiple students to state competition each year.', '2025-02-10 15:43:00-04', null),
(18, 'Palmview Elementary', '1131', 1, 'Our outstanding Environmental Science Magnet Program that features standards-based instruction, hands-on lessons and activities, hands-on experiments, environmental exploratory learning and field trips demonstrated the highest learning gains in Broward County on the Florida Statewide Science Assessment in 2023-2024.', '2025-02-13 13:26:00-04', null),
(18, 'Palmview Elementary', '1131', 2, 'Our school earned the “Outstanding Leadership Award” in 2025 from the Florida Tax Watch for outstanding Florida Assessment of Student Thinking (FAST) student performance data in reading, math and science.', '2025-02-13 13:26:00-04', null),
(18, 'Palmview Elementary', '1131', 3, 'Our school was ranked # 1 in the State of Florida amongst traditional elementary schools for math learning gains in 2021-2022 on the Florida Assessment of Student Thinking (FAST).', '2025-02-13 13:26:00-04', null),
(18, 'Palmview Elementary', '1131', 4, 'Palmview was recognized as an A+ Rated School in all 7 out of the 8 in subgroups categories in accordance with the State of Florida School Grading Program.', '2025-02-13 13:26:00-04', null),
(18, 'Palmview Elementary', '1131', 5, 'Our school was recognized as a Florida Title I School of Distinction for outstanding academic achievement.', '2025-02-13 13:26:00-04', null),
(19, 'Tequesta Trace Middle', '3151', 1, 'Award-Winning Programs: We are in the top ten schools in the Country for most poems published in the Young American Poetry Digest Haiku Competition, we also earned 1st place in the National History Day Competition and our Speech & Debate students have won over ten 1st place medals in Public Forum, Student Congress, Informative Speech and Lincoln-Douglas debates.', '2025-02-14 11:56:00-04', null),
(19, 'Tequesta Trace Middle', '3151', 2, 'Academic Excellence: We are one of the top three middle schools in the district for our students ELA scores and have the largest increase in the percent of level three and above students in math, helping us maintain our “A” school grade every year since 1999.', '2025-02-14 11:56:00-04', null),
(19, 'Tequesta Trace Middle', '3151', 3, 'Cultural Enrichment: Our student artwork won “Best in Show” at the Art in the Capitol Exhibit and represents Broward County in the Capitol building, we also have two 1st place winners in the National School Lunch Poster Contest, while eight of our band students were selected to the Broward All-County Concert Band and five to the Broward All-County Honors Jazz Band, rounding off the many achievements, our students are 1st place winners of the 2025 BCPS Chess Championship.', '2025-02-14 11:56:00-04', null),
(19, 'Tequesta Trace Middle', '3151', 4, 'Athletic Achievements: Our athletic department is competitive and well recognized in Broward County with both boys and girls Track & Field MSAA County Champions 23/24, boys and girls Cross Country MSAA County Champions 24/25, boys soccer MSAA County Champions 24/25 and boys individual golf MSAA County Champion 24/25.', '2025-02-14 11:56:00-04', null),
(19, 'Tequesta Trace Middle', '3151', 5, 'Community Impact: Our Latinos In Action, Peer Counseling and Civics students have been giving back to our community in spades heading projects such as, tutoring at feeder elementary schools, tutoring their peers, Harvest Drive, Holiday Letters to Heroes, Joe DiMaggio Children’s Hospital Toy Collection and care packages for Foster Care children in our community.', '2025-02-14 11:56:00-04', null),
(20, 'Palmview Elementary', '1131', 1, 'Our outstanding Environmental Science Magnet Program that features standards-based instruction, hands-on lessons and activities, hands-on experiments, environmental exploratory learning and field trips demonstrated the highest learning gains in Broward County on the Florida Statewide Science Assessment in 2023-2024.', '2025-02-20 11:28:00-04', null),
(20, 'Palmview Elementary', '1131', 2, 'Our school earned the “Outstanding Leadership Award” in 2025 from the Florida Tax Watch for outstanding Florida Assessment of Student Thinking (FAST) student performance data in reading, math and science.', '2025-02-20 11:28:00-04', null),
(20, 'Palmview Elementary', '1131', 3, 'Our school was ranked #1 in the State of Florida amongst traditional elementary schools for math learning gains in 2021-2022 on the Florida Assessment of Student Thinking (FAST).', '2025-02-20 11:28:00-04', null),
(20, 'Palmview Elementary', '1131', 4, 'Palmview was recognized as an A+ Rated School in all 7 out of the 8 in subgroups categories in accordance with the State of Florida School Grading Program.', '2025-02-20 11:28:00-04', null),
(20, 'Palmview Elementary', '1131', 5, 'Our school was recognized as a Florida Title I School of Distinction for outstanding academic achievement.', '2025-02-20 11:28:00-04', null),
(20, 'Palmview Elementary', '1131', 6, 'We offer over 7 teacher-lead afterschool clubs including basketball, soccer, robotics, dance, Minecraft, cheerleading, Mentoring, STEP Team, and arts and crafts.', '2025-02-20 11:28:00-04', null),
(21, 'Pioneer Middle', '2571', 1, 'Pioneer Middle has been an "A" rated school since the beginning of school grades over twenty years ago.', '2025-03-03 11:34:00-04', null),
(21, 'Pioneer Middle', '2571', 2, 'Pioneer is annually at the top or near the top in overall points for middle schools in Broward.', '2025-03-03 11:34:00-04', null),
(21, 'Pioneer Middle', '2571', 3, 'Since 2020, Pioneer has improved by over 90 points and gained almost 40 points in the acceleration category alone.', '2025-03-03 11:34:00-04', null),
(21, 'Pioneer Middle', '2571', 4, 'This season the Pioneer Girls Soccer team was a County Finalist and our Boys Flag Football team made it to the County Semi-Finals.', '2025-03-03 11:34:00-04', null),
(21, 'Pioneer Middle', '2571', 5, 'Pioneer is a true community school and a school that prides itself in legacy. Many parents and even grandparents went to Pioneer Middle. Quite a few of our current staff members attended Pioneer Middle when they were in school and the majority of our staff have children that previously attended Pioneer, currently attending Pioneer, or will one day attend Pioneer.', '2025-03-03 11:34:00-04', null),
(21, 'Pioneer Middle', '2571', 6, 'Pioneer take tremendous pride in educating the whole child by balancing academic prowess along with high interest student electives, clubs, sports and activities. For example, Pioneer has one of the top ranked middle school bands in all of Florida, robotics teams that outperform middle and high school teams, as well as the very last woodshop course in Broward County middle schools which is one of our most popular courses.', '2025-03-03 11:34:00-04', null),
(22, 'Boulevard Heights Elementary', '0971', 1, 'Cambridge School – Providing a rigorous and globally recognized academic program.', '2025-03-24 19:28:00-04', null),
