(44, 'Country Hills Elementary', '3111', 1, 'Country Hills Elementary is proud to be an ''A'' rated school, dedicated to excellence for ALL students. We strive to provide a supportive and challenging learning environment that nurtures every child’s potential, ensuring that each student has the opportunity to succeed and thrive academically, socially, and personally. Our commitment to excellence drives everything we do, making sure all students reach their full potential.', '2025-04-15 19:06:00-04', null),
(44, 'Country Hills Elementary', '3111', 2, 'At Country Hills Elementary, we are fortunate to have an exceptionally active PTA that works hand-in-hand with our teachers and families to create and enhance a positive, supportive learning environment for both our students and staff. Their dedication and collaboration makes a lasting impact on our school community!', '2025-04-15 19:06:00-04', null),
(44, 'Country Hills Elementary', '3111', 3, 'At Country Hills Elementary, our faculty and staff are what truly set us apart. Their dedication, knowledge, and passion for education create a welcoming and inspiring environment where every student can thrive. With a deep commitment to fostering growth and success, our team makes CHE not just a school, but a place where students feel valued, supported, and excited to learn.', '2025-04-15 19:06:00-04', null),
(44, 'Country Hills Elementary', '3111', 4, 'At Country Hills Elementary, we take pride in offering a robust on-site aftercare program, run by our very own dedicated staff. This enriching program provides a safe, supportive environment where students receive homework help, engage in a variety of extracurricular activities, and enjoy valuable social time with peers. It’s just one of the many ways we ensure the well-being and growth of our students, both inside and outside the classroom.', '2025-04-15 19:06:00-04', null),
(44, 'Country Hills Elementary', '3111', 5, 'At Country Hills Elementary, we believe in developing well-balanced students who are prepared for both academic success and future leadership. In addition to our rigorous academic instruction, we plan a variety of activities and events throughout the year to enhance learning, foster creativity, and build essential leadership skills. These opportunities help our students grow as confident, well-rounded individuals, ready to take on the challenges of tomorrow.', '2025-04-15 19:06:00-04', null),
(44, 'Country Hills Elementary', '3111', 6, 'At Country Hills Elementary, we believe in recognizing and celebrating the positive character of our students. Each month, we hold our Rising Star Assembly, where we honor students who demonstrate outstanding character, leadership, and kindness. This special event highlights the importance of personal growth and helps foster a strong sense of community and pride within our school.', '2025-04-15 19:06:00-04', null),
