(48, 'Sheridan Technical High', '1051', 3, 'Congratulations to Mrs. Friedman and our outstanding Speech & Debate team — proudly known as the Big Bad Wolves — for their remarkable performance in their final competition before Nationals. These talented students, now recognized as the Broward Champs, demonstrated exceptional skill, determination, and teamwork, leaving a lasting impression and solidifying their reputation as a force to be reckoned with. We offer our sincere gratitude to Mrs. Friedman for her unwavering commitment, guidance, and tireless efforts in preparing our students for excellence.', '2025-05-13 08:08:00-04', null),
(48, 'Sheridan Technical High', '1051', 4, 'Last Saturday, the Sheridan Technical High School Beowulves finished their slam poetry competition season. The team brought their A-game to the stage, earning 3rd in the competition in the Semifinal round. It truly was a battle of the mics with Cynthia M. crushing the competition, earing the highest scores of our team that night!', '2025-05-13 08:08:00-04', null),
