(166, 'Thurgood Marshall Elementary', '3291', 1, 'At Thurgood Marshall Elementary, we believe in celebrating the outstanding achievements, programs, and initiatives that make our school shine. Below are just a few of our Proud Points — proof that when the lights come on and the cameras roll, our students and staff are always ready for action!', '2025-12-12 13:51:00-04', null),
(166, 'Thurgood Marshall Elementary', '3291', 2, '• TME All ProDads Chapter: This initiative celebrates and promotes the important role of fathers and father figures in the lives of our students. • 5000 Role Model of Excellence Mentoring Program: We are proud to offer students guidance and inspiration through this distinguished mentoring initiative, fostering leadership and personal growth.', '2025-12-12 13:51:00-04', null),
(166, 'Thurgood Marshall Elementary', '3291', 3, '• S.A.V.E. Promise: Our school actively participates in the S.A.V.E. Promise, empowering students to create a safe, inclusive, and positive learning environment. • TME “EAGLES” Safety Patrols: Dedicated student leaders help maintain safety in our school community, serving as positive examples for their peers.', '2025-12-12 13:51:00-04', null),
(166, 'Thurgood Marshall Elementary', '3291', 4, '• TME DEBATERS: Our debate team encourages critical thinking, effective communication, and respectful discourse, preparing students for success in and out of the classroom.', '2025-12-12 13:51:00-04', null),
(166, 'Thurgood Marshall Elementary', '3291', 5, '• DO GOOD FOR 1 – STEM Initiative (Grade 2): Second graders engage in hands-on STEM activities designed to spark curiosity and encourage doing good through science and technology.', '2025-12-12 13:51:00-04', null),
(166, 'Thurgood Marshall Elementary', '3291', 6, '• W-TME “Morning Announcements” Crew: Our energetic student crew delivers daily announcements, building confidence and communication skills while uniting the school community. • Afterschool  (ELO) Clubs: Spanish, Cooking, Dance/Cheer, Basketball', '2025-12-12 13:51:00-04', null),
