(177, 'Everglades Elementary', '2942', 1, 'Our school is proud to announce an A grade, recognizing the dedication of our students, staff, and community. This achievement reflects our commitment to academic excellence and ongoing educational growth.', '2025-12-15 12:25:00-04', null),
