(211, 'Walker Elementary', '0321', 1, '•B-Rated School  As a B-rated school, we are proud to be advancing on a clear path toward earning an A. Our dedication to academic excellence reflects the hard work and partnership of our students, staff, and families.', '2026-01-30 13:00:00-04', null),
(211, 'Walker Elementary', '0321', 2, '•Heart, Drive, and High Expectations  From classroom instruction to extracurricular programs, our approach prioritizes the whole child by nurturing academic achievement, creativity, collaboration, and character every step of the way.', '2026-01-30 13:00:00-04', null),
(211, 'Walker Elementary', '0321', 3, '•Powered by Data, Driven by Students  At Walker, data isn''t just numbers, it''s a tool for empowerment. Students track their growth in personal data folders and present their progress at mid-year and year-end showcase events. Parents are active partners through our twice-yearly Data Date Nights.', '2026-01-30 13:00:00-04', null),
(211, 'Walker Elementary', '0321', 4, '•Walker’s Performing Arts Magnet Program  Our Performing Arts Magnet Program provides students with a vibrant and engaging introduction to the world of visual and performing arts. Through hands-on experiences in dance, drama, band, and chorus, every student has the opportunity to explore their inner artist. What makes our program truly unique is that all students are encouraged to try each discipline before choosing the area that best aligns with their passion and talents. This approach allows them to discover their artistic voice while building', '2026-01-30 13:00:00-04', null),
(211, 'Walker Elementary', '0321', 5, '•Innovation in Every Corner  Whether through tech-rich classrooms, creative enrichment opportunities, or leadershipdriven initiatives, Walker is a school where innovation thrives and every learner shines.', '2026-01-30 13:00:00-04', null),
(211, 'Walker Elementary', '0321', 6, 'All-in-One Afterschool Experience  Our aftercare program is operated by the YMCA and is tailored to Walker students and families— combining homework support, extracurricular enrichment, and school-provided dinner in one seamless, supportive environment.', '2026-01-30 13:00:00-04', null),
