(241, 'Piper High School', '1901', 1, '• Academic Excellence: Over the past 3 years, Piper High School has increased more than 100 points in its Florida school grade which measures academic success and post-secondary preparedness across all core subjects', '2026-04-07 10:55:00-04', '2026-04-07'),
(241, 'Piper High School', '1901', 2, '• Advanced Academics: Piper High School has a highly successful Cambridge Program, with Cambridge Diploma recipients earning more than $7.7 million in Bright Futures scholarships.', '2026-04-07 10:55:00-04', '2026-04-07'),
(241, 'Piper High School', '1901', 3, '• Talented Student-Athletes: The Bengal Varsity Football Team advanced to the second round of the 2025 playoffs, qualified for the playoffs in 2024, and won the district title in 2023. The Varsity Flag Football Team has made the playoffs three consecutive years and earned a district championship.', '2026-04-07 10:55:00-04', '2026-04-07'),
(241, 'Piper High School', '1901', 4, 'The Piper High School Band of Pride: Our band competes at the county and state levels, consistently earning top honors, including 1st Place at the TapOff Drumline Competition under the direction of Mr. Kervens Jackson.', '2026-04-07 10:55:00-04', '2026-04-07'),
(241, 'Piper High School', '1901', 5, '• Theatre: Our award-winning Theatre Program presents multiple full-length productions each year, including The Wizard of Oz, Clue, The Addams Family, and You’re a Good Man, Charlie Brown, under the direction of Mr. Michael Kean.', '2026-04-07 10:55:00-04', '2026-04-07'),
(241, 'Piper High School', '1901', 6, '• Clubs/Student life: The Piper Men of Impact (MOI) program has earned multiple first-place trophies in competitions across Florida and the southern region under the leadership of Mr. Frank Pinkney.', '2026-04-07 10:55:00-04', '2026-04-07'),
