(262, 'Cypress Run Education Center', '2123', 1, 'Chief Internship - High school students participate in a program designed to give students a meaningful bridge between classroom learning and the professional world.', '2026-05-01 11:13:00-04', '2026-05-05'),
(262, 'Cypress Run Education Center', '2123', 2, 'Shine My Ride - This high school car detailing program is a hands-on learning experience that blends technical skill-building with entrepreneurship and responsibility. Students learn how to properly clean, restore, and protect vehicles-inside and out-while gaining insight into how a small business operates.', '2026-05-01 11:13:00-04', '2026-05-05'),
(262, 'Cypress Run Education Center', '2123', 3, 'Healing Garden - This colorful garden was created by our middle school students and is filled with fruits and vegetables. This garden was designed not just to grow food, but to feel peaceful.', '2026-05-01 11:13:00-04', '2026-05-05'),
(262, 'Cypress Run Education Center', '2123', 4, 'Culinary Arts - A dynamic, hands-on experience where students learn the fundamentals of cooking while exploring creativity, culture, and teamwork. Students take pride in preparing meals they can share with others, gaining a sense of accomplishment and independence.', '2026-05-01 11:13:00-04', '2026-05-05'),
(262, 'Cypress Run Education Center', '2123', 5, 'Chief Mentorship - Every student is assigned a mentor from the school to create meaningful, supportive connections to help our students grow both academically and personally. Students are paired with a trusted adult - such as teachers or staff for guidance, encouragement, and consistent support throughout the school year.', '2026-05-01 11:13:00-04', '2026-05-05'),
(262, 'Cypress Run Education Center', '2123', 6, 'Robotics Program - an engaging hands-on course where students design, build, and program machines. This class blends engineering, coding and creativity in a way that encourages experimentation and problem-solving.', '2026-05-01 11:13:00-04', '2026-05-05'),
